      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Peixe-Alado. A linha que percorre o corpo de Finneon armazena luz solar e brilha intensamente durante a noite. As áreas rosadas de sua pele absorvem essa luz, e acredita-se que o brilho funcione como camuflagem.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Água 2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Finneon pode evoluir para Lumineon no nível 11 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Pound</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Water Gun</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Attract</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Rain Dance</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Gust</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Water Pulse</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Captivate</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Safeguard</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Aqua Ring</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Whirlpool</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>U-turn</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Bounce, Silver Wind, Tailwind</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>16</td><td>Soak</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Acrobatics, Agility, Alluring Voice, Aqua Tail, Attract, Baby-Doll Eyes, Blizzard, Bounce, Charm, Chilling Water, Confide, Confuse Ray, Dazzling Gleam, Defog, Double Team, Endure, Facade, Flip Turn, Frustration, Hail, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Hydro Pump, Ice Beam, Icy Wind, Nature Power, Ominous Wind, Payback, Protect, Psybeam, Psych Up, Rain Dance, Rest, Return, Round, Safeguard, Scald, Signal Beam, Sleep Talk, Snore, Substitute, Surf, Swagger, Swift, Tailwind, Take Down, Tera Blast, Thief, Toxic, U-turn, Water Pulse, Waterfall, Whirlpool</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Agility, Aqua Tail, Aurora Beam, Brine, Charm, Confuse Ray, Flail, Psybeam, Signal Beam, Splash, Sweet Kiss, Tickle</p>",
